        "created_at": "2013-04-20T15:45:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You get to laugh in the villain's face. It doesn't mention the trash so it doesn't apply to the trash. You searched the deck and found nothing. Sucks to be a giant abomination of science, I guess.</p>",
